sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Redis as Redis / RQ
    participant Worker as RQ Worker
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Redis->>Worker: Deliver Job Task
    Worker->>DB: Update Status -> RUNNING (Record Attempt)
    Worker->>Worker: Execute Task Logic
    alt Success
        Worker->>DB: Update Status -> SUCCEEDED (Save Result)
        Worker->>Redis: Acknowledge Message
    else Transient Failure / Retry Available
        Worker->>DB: Update Status -> RETRY_WAIT (Record Error)
        Worker->>Redis: Schedule Retry
    else Permanent Failure / Exhausted
        Worker->>DB: Update Status -> FAILED (Record Terminal Error)
        Worker->>Redis: Acknowledge Message
    end
